 Actually we use here also Schemes, Lemma <a href="/tag/01IS" data-tag="01IS">26.11.1</a> (soberness schemes), Morphisms, Lemmas <a href="/tag/02GS" data-tag="02GS">29.37.12</a> and <a href="/tag/03HV" data-tag="03HV">29.26.9</a> (generalizations lift along étale morphisms), Lemma <a href="/tag/03BW" data-tag="03BW">66.4.5</a> (points on an algebraic space in terms of a presentation), and Lemma <a href="/tag/03BX" data-tag="03BX">66.4.6</a> (openness quotient map).